        {
            "parameters": {
                "promptType": "define",
                "text": "=You are an expert AI sales lead qualification assistant working for a business that provides automation services.\n\nYour job is to analyze incoming leads, understand their business needs, assess their readiness to purchase, and recommend the next sales action.\n\n{{ JSON.stringify({\n  name: $json.name,\n  email: $json.email,\n  company: $json.company,\n  service: $json.service,\n  budget: $json.budget,\n  timeline: $json.timeline,\n  message: $json.message\n}) }}\n\nAnalyze these factors:\n1. Business need: What problem does the lead want to solve?\n2. Service fit: Is the requested service relevant to the business's offerings?\n3. Budget: Is a budget provided, and does it appear suitable? Never assume missing budget information.\n4. Urgency: How soon does the lead need the service?\n5. Intent: Does the lead clearly express a genuine business requirement?\n6. Information gaps: What important information is missing?\n\nAssign priority using these guidelines:\n- High: Clear business need, strong intent, and a suitable budget or urgent timeline.\n- Medium: Relevant need, but budget, timeline, or requirements need clarification.\n- Low: Vague request, weak intent, or insufficient information to recommend immediate sales action.\n\nDo not automatically classify a lead as High just because the budget is large. Do not invent facts, claim certainty about conversion, or discriminate based on personal characteristics.\n\nReturn ONLY one valid JSON object with exactly these keys:\n\n{\n  \"lead_summary\": \"A concise summary of the lead's requirements\",\n  \"service_fit\": \"Good, Partial, or Poor\",\n  \"interest_level\": \"High, Medium, or Low\",\n  \"urgency\": \"High, Medium, or Low\",\n  \"priority\": \"High, Medium, or Low\",\n  \"missing_information\": \"Important missing details, or None\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"One specific next sales action\",\n  \"reply_email_subject\": \"A suitable email subject\",\n  \"reply_email_body\": \"A polite, personalized draft response\"\n}\n\nThe email must acknowledge the lead's stated needs and suggest a relevant next step. Do not claim that a meeting is booked, a service is available, or a price is approved unless the supplied information confirms it.\n\nUse only the lead information provided. If a detail is missing, state that it is missing.\n\nReturn valid JSON only. Do not include Markdown fences or commentary outside the JSON object.",
                "hasOutputParser": true,
                "options": {}
            },
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
            "typeVersion": 3.1,
            "position": [
                1232,
                -48
            ],
            "id": "28ab48cf-fe80-4f07-bb56-5a2ba54c4309",
            "name": "AI Agent"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "schemaType": "manual",
                "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"lead_summary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"service_fit\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"Good\", \"Partial\", \"Poor\"]\n    },\n    \"interest_level\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]\n    },\n    \"urgency\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]\n    },\n    \"priority\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]\n    },\n    \"missing_information\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"recommended_action\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"reply_email_subject\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"reply_email_body\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"lead_summary\",\n    \"service_fit\",\n    \"interest_level\",\n    \"urgency\",\n    \"priority\",\n    \"missing_information\",\n    \"recommended_action\",\n    \"reply_email_subject\",\n    \"reply_email_body\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"
            },
